WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:03.939
♪ (GENTLE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:04.039 --> 00:00:07.373
Hi, I'm Susie Essman
from Curb Your Enthusiasm.

00:00:07.649 --> 00:00:09.851
If you're like me,
there's nothing better than

00:00:10.051 --> 00:00:12.848
kicking back and relaxing
after a long day.

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:16.350
But sometimes,
it's hard to turn off the world

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.354
and de-stress
without the right soundtrack

00:00:19.429 --> 00:00:20.445
to get you there.

00:00:20.704 --> 00:00:21.826
Until now.

00:00:22.248 --> 00:00:25.327
Presenting...
The Sweet Sounds of Susie.

00:00:25.526 --> 00:00:27.852
There's no music,
there's no tempo.

00:00:28.177 --> 00:00:29.865
It's just me, Susie,

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:32.776
reciting my most soothing lines
from Curb,

00:00:32.951 --> 00:00:35.954
with absolutely no filler.

00:00:36.514 --> 00:00:38.507
Featuring such classics as...

00:00:40.085 --> 00:00:42.678
(READS YELLOW PROMPTS)

00:01:03.632 --> 00:01:06.235
...and more.
The collection has it all.

00:01:06.542 --> 00:01:07.579
So why wait?

00:01:07.904 --> 00:01:10.529
Listen to
The Sweet Sounds of Susie today

00:01:10.657 --> 00:01:13.200
and sleep like a baby tonight.

00:01:13.516 --> 00:01:14.991
You can thank me later.

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:18.585
Listen to
The Sweet Sounds of Susie

00:01:18.714 --> 00:01:20.662
presented by
Curb Your Enthusiasm,

00:01:20.764 --> 00:01:22.217
available on Spotify.

